      "description": "Whispering Pines Resort by Casa De Bello is a 4-star boutique heritage mountain resort located on the Bhowali-Ramgarh-Mukteshwar Road in Malla Ramgarh, Uttarakhand. The property features 25 premium rooms and a private villa perched at 1,780 metres altitude with 180 degree panoramic views of the Nanda Devi and Trishul Himalayan peaks. Surrounded by private apple, peach, plum and apricot orchards and dense pine canopies, the resort offers a swimming pool, multi-cuisine restaurant, stone fireplace rooms, 150 Mbps fiber Wi-Fi and pet-friendly enclosed gardens. Built as the upgraded successor to Clarks Exotica Mukteshwar, Whispering Pines caters to families on Himalayan vacations, honeymooners, remote workers on extended workcation stays and multi-generational groups seeking a premium Uttarakhand retreat.",
      "telephone": "+91-7505029696",
      "email": "booking@whisperingpinesresort.in",
      "priceRange": "₹₹₹",
      "currenciesAccepted": "INR",
